{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What kind of game is it?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>desktop idle \u00d7 observation game</strong> where you catch strange little creatures, raise them, grow vegetables, and pay off your debt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leave it running on your desktop, or poke at it whenever you like\u2014both are valid ways to play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4138740/extras/70004a1b7ab5ce514848b74a473a51df.poster.avif?t=1773982145\" width=720 height=720 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4138740/extras/70004a1b7ab5ce514848b74a473a51df.webm?t=1773982145\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4138740/extras/70004a1b7ab5ce514848b74a473a51df.mp4?t=1773982145\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The fun of raising creatures</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pay off your debt and unlock <strong>eggs</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once unlocked, feed them and let them multiply.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy watching them grow <i>pop, pop, pop</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be careful\u2014if they get too hungry, they might start slacking off.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4138740/extras/260376bd75bdc6e185d783136ef229b0.poster.avif?t=1773982145\" width=720 height=720 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4138740/extras/260376bd75bdc6e185d783136ef229b0.webm?t=1773982145\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4138740/extras/260376bd75bdc6e185d783136ef229b0.mp4?t=1773982145\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Capturing with the UFO</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once there are lots of strange creatures, capture them with your <strong>UFO</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thanks to the combo system, even large crowds are easy to handle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vacuuming them up is strangely addictive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collecting all that popping <strong>Love</strong> is satisfying too.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4138740/extras/cc5d032fc38931fcb296dc79776f3260.poster.avif?t=1773982145\" width=720 height=720 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4138740/extras/cc5d032fc38931fcb296dc79776f3260.webm?t=1773982145\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4138740/extras/cc5d032fc38931fcb296dc79776f3260.mp4?t=1773982145\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Skill system</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Doing the same thing over and over can get boring, right?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No worries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By unlocking a wide variety of skills, you can:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Capture many creatures at once</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn lots more coins</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When should you unlock each skill? That\u2019s up to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4138740/extras/d42f5d8cb240dbf1282f4b1ae1d358c3.poster.avif?t=1773982145\" width=720 height=720 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4138740/extras/d42f5d8cb240dbf1282f4b1ae1d358c3.webm?t=1773982145\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4138740/extras/d42f5d8cb240dbf1282f4b1ae1d358c3.mp4?t=1773982145\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Watching the farm</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They single-mindedly plant seeds and water crops.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adorable, isn\u2019t it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more you capture with the UFO, the more farm creatures you\u2019ll get.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4138740/extras/25dedb717b85f9dd8cf29a32652a6a91.poster.avif?t=1773982145\" width=720 height=720 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4138740/extras/25dedb717b85f9dd8cf29a32652a6a91.webm?t=1773982145\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4138740/extras/25dedb717b85f9dd8cf29a32652a6a91.mp4?t=1773982145\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rare drops</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The creatures sometimes seem to pick up toys from somewhere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect them all and something good might happen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(35 types in total!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By the way\u2014you can hang up the toys you find.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4138740/extras/3ad3a3c82a41a11459a046c2bee85b73.poster.avif?t=1773982145\" width=720 height=720 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4138740/extras/3ad3a3c82a41a11459a046c2bee85b73.webm?t=1773982145\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4138740/extras/3ad3a3c82a41a11459a046c2bee85b73.mp4?t=1773982145\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4138740/extras/714e873b5be6df2e71df52cec09abf49.poster.avif?t=1773982145\" width=720 height=720 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4138740/extras/714e873b5be6df2e71df52cec09abf49.webm?t=1773982145\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4138740/extras/714e873b5be6df2e71df52cec09abf49.mp4?t=1773982145\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Paying off your debt</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not sure what to do next? It\u2019s okay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The bottom-left corner always shows a suggested next step.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more farm creatures you have, the faster you can repay your debt\u2014and unlock new companions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also earn money by vacuuming seaweed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But in the end, the best way to play is simply\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>however you like.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4138740/extras/76182b8f9961db7b35754d34b0d85965.poster.avif?t=1773982145\" width=720 height=720 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4138740/extras/76182b8f9961db7b35754d34b0d85965.webm?t=1773982145\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4138740/extras/76182b8f9961db7b35754d34b0d85965.mp4?t=1773982145\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Right-click to turn Love into sand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something happens after you unlock rare drops\u2026?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4138740/extras/34253b51812c35dc5c79015169d98213.poster.avif?t=1773982145\" width=720 height=720 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4138740/extras/34253b51812c35dc5c79015169d98213.webm?t=1773982145\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4138740/extras/34253b51812c35dc5c79015169d98213.mp4?t=1773982145\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This work uses sound effects from the <strong>OtoLogic</strong> sound library.<br>BGM by mi!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4138740?t=1773982145","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4138740?t=1773982145","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4138740/b25917bc03d4669a1d2176ad9ac954155ca848d2/capsule_231x87_alt_assets_0.jpg?t=1773982145","capsule_imagev5":"https://sha