"bb_paragraph\" >Earn lots more coins</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When should you unlock each skill? That\u2019s up to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4138740/extras/d42f5d8cb240dbf1282f4b1ae1d358c3.poster.avif?t=1773982145\" width=720 height=720 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4138740/extras/d42f5d8cb240dbf1282f4b1ae1d358c3.webm?t=1773982145\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4138740/extras/d42f5d8cb240dbf1282f4b1ae1d358c3.mp4?t=1773982145\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Watching the farm</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They single-mindedly plant seeds and water crops.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adorable, isn\u2019t it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more you capture with the UFO, the more farm creatures you\u2019ll get.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4138740/extras/25dedb717b85f9dd8cf29a32652a6a91.poster.avif?t=1773982145\" width=720 height=720 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4138740/extras/25dedb717b85f9dd8cf29a32652a6a91.webm?t=1773982145\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4138740/extras/25dedb717b85f9dd8cf29a32652a6a91.mp4?t=1773982145\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rare drops</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The creatures sometimes seem to pick up toys from somewhere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect them all and something good might happen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(35 types in total!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By the way\u2014you can hang up the toys you find.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4138740/extras/3ad3a3c82a41a11459a046c2bee85b73.poster.avif?t=1773982145\" width=720 height=720 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4138740/extras/3ad3a3c82a41a11459a046c2bee85b73.webm?t=1773982145\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4138740/extras/3ad3a3c82a41a11459a046c2bee85b73.mp4?t=1773982145\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4138740/extras/714e873b5be6df2e71df52cec09abf49.poster.avif?t=1773982145\" width=720 height=720 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4138740/extras/714e873b5be6df2e71df52cec09abf49.webm?t=1773982145\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4138740/extras/714e873b5be6df2e71df52cec09abf49.mp4?t=1773982145\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Paying off your debt</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not sure what to do next? It\u2019s okay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The bottom-left corner always shows a suggested next step.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more farm creatures you have, the faster you can repay your debt\u2014and unlock new companions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also earn money by vacuum